      "section": "Differential expression",
      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "Every gene DESeq2 tested, placed by effect size against adjusted significance,\nwith both thresholds drawn in. This is a real nf-core/differentialabundance run,\nso the cloud has the shape real data has: most genes sit near the origin and the\ninteresting ones are the handful far from it. Raising the significance floor or\nthe mean-expression floor on the left drops the low-information tail.\n",
      "wf_tag": "nf-core/nfcore_megatests"
    },
